    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "OKAFOR (TAPE)",
      "Ada. It talks in my voice now. Not to me — to the others. Pell came to my office at midnight because I called him on the radio. I never called him."
     ],
     "vo": "okafor_820ce587af"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
