     "vo": "mira_8cab29e6b4"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "MIRA (96.1 MHz)",
      "He looked right at me through the glass, and he shut it."
     ],
     "vo": "mira_c3d384516c"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "DANIEL",
      "Why would he do that?"
     ],
     "vo": "daniel_bb6c93e878"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "MIRA (96.1 MHz)",
      "Because it was in here with us. Because twenty-three is a smaller number than forty-one."
